chromatography on silica gel using a mixture of ethyl acetate and hexane
(5/95 to 50/50) as eluant. 4'-Acetylbenzoic acid (3g), yield 72%. 1H NMR
(400 MHz, d6-DMSO) δ 13.35 (s, 1H), 8.06 (s, 4H), 2.63 (s, 3H); 13C NMR
(100 MHz, d6-DMSO) δ 196.3, 165.2, 138.4, 133.1, 128.1, 126.9, 25.6; MS
(CI, m/z, %) 181 (100) [M+NH3]+; Anal. calcd for C9H8O3: C, 65.85; H,
4.91. Found: C, 65.79; H, 4.92.
