$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Pd-Catalyzed Intramolecular C-N Bond Cleavage, 1,4-Migration, sp3 C-H
Activation, and Heck Reaction: Four Controllable Diverse Pathways
Depending on the Judicious Choice of the Base and Ligand
