$DATUM (E)-N-tert-Butyl-4-cyclohexylpenta-2,4-dienamide (entry 8). Lithium
chloride (169.6 mg, 4.00 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02 mmol),
1-cyclohexylvinyl diphenyl phosphate (215.0 mg, 0.60 mmol), N-tert-butyl
acrylamide (50.9 mg, 0.40 mmol), Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol), PdCl2(COD)
(5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol) dissolved in a 1:1 DMF-Dioxane mixture (3 mL) were
reacted for 24 h at 100°C. The crude product was purified by flash
chromatography on silica gel using CH2Cl2:Et2O (49:1) as eluent. This
afforded 65.9 mg of the title compound (70% yield) as a colorless solid.
1H NMR (400 MHz, CD3CN) δ (ppm) 7.22 (d, 1H, J =15.6 Hz), 6.43 (bs, 1H,
NH), 6.21 (d, 1H, J = 15.6 Hz), 5.37 (t, 1H, J = 0.8 Hz), 5.29 (t, 1H, J
= 0.8 Hz), 2.37-2.30 (m, 1H), 1.93-1.78 (m, 5H), 1.52-1.38 (m, 2H), 1.46
(s, 9H), 1.375-1-25 (m, 3H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CD3CN:C6D6 (1:1)) δ (ppm)
166.2, 151.9, 141.6, 123.2, 118.6, 51.7, 40.8, 33.7, 29.1, 27.7, 27.2.
HRMS C15H25ON [M++Na]: calculate: 258.1834 found: 258.1823.
