$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Procedure for Catalytic Reactions. A
10 mL Schlenk ?ask was charged with [(cinnamyl)PdCl]2 (26 mg, 1 mol %),
2-(di-1-adamantylphosphino)-1-(2, 6-diisopropylphenyl)-1H-imidazole
(105.8 mg, 4 mol %), NEt3 (1.4 mL, 2 equiv), and dioxane (2.5 mL). Then,
hexadecane (1 mL, internal GC standard) and 0.98 mL of this clear, brown
stock solution were transferred into four vials (12 mL reaction volume)
equipped with a septum, a small cannula, a stirring bar, 1 mmol of the
corresponding aryl iodides and 6 mmol of styrenes. The vials were placed
in an alloy plate, which was transferred into a 300-mL autoclave of the
4560 series from Parr Instruments under argon atmosphere. After ?ushing
the autoclave three times with CO and adjusting the pressure to 5 bar,
the reaction was performed for 20 h at 100 °C. After the reaction, the
autoclave was cooled down to room temperature, and the pressure was
released carefully. The product was washed with water and extracted with
2 mL of ethyl acetate three times; after being concentrated under reduced
pressure, the product was puri?ed by silica gel chromatography using
n-heptane/AcOEt (40:1) as an eluent.
(E)-1-(4-Ethylphenyl)-3-phenylprop-2-en-1-one 2c, Yield :66%.
n-Heptane-EtOAc: 40:1. MP: 54-57°C. Rf = 0.1. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ
7.84 (d, 2H, J= 8.5Hz, HAr) , 7.68 (d, 1H, J= 15.6Hz, CH═), 7.46-7.52 (m,
2H, HAr) , 7.42 (d, 1H, J= 15.6Hz, CH═), 7.22-7.29 (m, 3H, HAr) , 7.18
(d, 2H, J= 8.6Hz, HAr), 2.57 (q, 2H, J= 7.6Hz, CH2CH3), 1.13 (t, 3H, J=
7.5Hz, CH2CH3). 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3): δ 190.0 (CO), 149.9 (CH), 144.4
(Cquat), 135.9 (Cquat), 135.0 (Cquat), 130.5 (CH), 129.0 (CH), 128.8
(CH), 128.5 (CH), 128.2 (CH), 122.1 (CH), 29.0 (CH2), 15.3 (CH3). IR
(ATR, cm-1): 3059 (vw), 3027 (vw), 2965 (m), 2931 (w), 2873 (vw), 1781
(vw), 1719 (vw), 1660 (s), 1597 (vs), 1575 (m), 1495 (w), 1449 (m), 1413
(w), 1331 (s), 1304 (m), 1285 (m), 1218 (vs), 1177 (vs), 1119 (vw), 1053
(w), 1031 (s), 1011 (s), 977 (vs), 889 (vw), 830 (s), 754 (vs), 693 (s),
673 (s), 636 (vw), 613 (vw), 562 (s), 509 (w), 481 (w). GC-MS (EI, 70eV):
m/z(%)=236(M+, 80), 235(M+-H, 100), 207(M+-C2H5+, 50), 193(10), 179(15),
133(M+-C6H5CHCH+, 25), 103(C6H5CHCH+, 20), 77(C6H5+, 20). HRMS (ESI):
C17H17O (M + H)+, Calcd: 237.1274; Found: 237.1278.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, Heck reaction, autoclave used, alternative preparation
shown
