$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Trifluoromethanesulfonic acid ( Z)-2-{benzyl-[2-(2-oxo-3,3-spiro[1,3-
dioxolane]-2,3-dihydro-1H-indol-7-yl)-pent-2-enoyl]-amino}-phenyl ester
(9).3 An Air-free® flask was charged with Pd2dba3·CHCl3 (115 mg, 111
mmol), P(2-furyl)3 (158 mg, 666 mmol) and freshly distilled
N-methylpyrolidinone (NMP, 8 mL). The mixture was deoxygenated by
bubbling Ar through a submerged needle for 2 hr, during which time a
bright yellow solution resulted. A deoxygenated solution of stannane 7
(390 mg, 555 mmol), iodide 8 (194 mg, 611 mmol) and NMP (3 mL) was then
added via syringe. Copper(I) iodide (211 mg, 1.11 mmol) was added and the
resulting reaction mixture was flushed with a stream of Ar for 15 min,
sealed and stirred at rt for 24 h. After diluting the reaction with EtOAc
(100 mL), KF was added until the mixture became transparent yellow. The
mixture was filtered and the filtrate was washed with H2O (50 mL) and
brine (50 mL). The organic layer was dried (Na2SO4), filtered and
concentrated. The crude residue was purified by flash chromatography (10%
ethyl acetatehexanes) to give 14 (211 mg, 350 mmol, 63%) as an off-white
solid Trifluoromethanesulfonic acid (Z
)-2-{benzyl-[2-(2-oxo-3,3-spiro[1,3-
dioxolane]-2,3-dihydro-1H-indol-7-yl)-pent-2-enoyl]-amino}-phenyl ester
(9), yield (211 mg, 350 mmol, 63%) as an off-white solid mp 150-152 °C
(MeOH); 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.83 (br s, 1H, NH), 7.31-7.20 (m, 7H,
ArH), 7.14 (d, J= 7.2 Hz, 1H, ArH), 6.91 (td, J= 7.7, 1.3 Hz, 1H, ArH),
6.79 (t, J= 7.6 Hz, 1H, ArH), 6.56 (dd, J= 8.0, 0.8 Hz, 1H, ArH), 6.21
(d, J= 7.7 Hz, 1H, ArH), 5.90 (d, J= 14.3 Hz, 1H, CH2), 5.49 (t, J= 7.6
Hz, 1H, CH), 4.52-4.44 (m, 2H, CH2), 4.27-4.22 (m, 2H, CH2), 3.90 (d, J=
14.3 Hz, 1H, CH2), 2.32-2.24 (m, 2H, CH2), 1.04 (t, J= 7.5 Hz, 3H, CH3);
13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ 174.34, 169.28, 145.43, 140.03 (br), 139.69,
136.63, 133.32, 132.83, 132.00, 130.59, 130.38, 129.46 (2C), 128.79 (2C),
128.32, 128.18, 124.89, 124.40, 123.03, 121.99, 120.99, 118.48 (q, JC,F =
320.0 Hz), 101.93, 65.99, 65.76, 52.18, 23.62, 13.62; IR (thin film)
3223, 2976, 2937, 2903, 1733, 1656, 1613, 1494, 1447, 1420, 1324, 1278,
1216, 1185, 1139, 1104, 1031, 1007, 946, 892, 853, 749, 703 cm-1; HRMS
(ESI+) Calcd for C29H25F3N2O7SNa(M+Na)+: 602.1232. Found: 625.1243. Anal.
Calcd for C29H25F3N2O7S: C, 57.80; H, 4.18; N, 4.65. Found: C, 57.63; H,
4.04; N, 4.64.
