$DATUM (E)-N-tert-Butyl-1’,1’-diphenylethyl penta-2,4-dienamide (entry 3).
Lithium chloride (169.6 mg, 4.00 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02 mmol),
3,3-diphenylbut-1-en-2-yl diphenyl phosphate (274.0 mg, 0.60 mmol),
N-tert-butyl acrylamide (50.9 mg, 0.40 mmol), Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol),
PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol) dissolved in a 1:1 DMF-Dioxane mixture (3
mL) were reacted for 24 h at 100°C. The crude product was purified by
flash chromatography on silica gel using CH2Cl2 as eluent. This afforded
84.0 mg of the title compound (63% yield) as a colorless solid. 1H NMR
(400 MHz, CD3CN:C6D6 (1:1)) δ (ppm) 7.06-6.95 (m, 9H), 6.87 (dd, 1H, J =
15.6, 1.6 Hz), 5.99 (bs, 1H, NH), 5.98 (d, 1H, J = 15.6 Hz), 5.42 (t, J =
1.0 Hz), 4.53 (t, 1H, J = 1.0 Hz), 1.67 (s, 3H), 1.11 (s, 9H). 13C NMR
(100 MHz, CD3CN:C6D6 (1:1)) δ (ppm) 164.8, 152.4, 146.7, 139.6, 128.7,
128.3, 126.5, 125.1, 116.9, 52.8, 50.9, 28.4, 28.0. HRMS C23H27ON
[M++Na]: calculate: 356.1990 found: 356.1984.
