$DATUM (E)-N-tert-Butyl-4-(3-methyl-2-oxotetrahydrofuran-3-yl)penta-2,4-dienamide
(entry 5). Lithium chloride (169.6 mg, 4.00 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02
mmol), 1-(3-methyl-2-oxotetrahydrofuran-3-yl)vinyl diphenyl phosphate
(225.0 mg, 0.60 mmol), N-tert-butyl acrylamide (50.9 mg, 0.40 mmol),
Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol), PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol) dissolved in a
1:1 DMF-Dioxane mixture (3 mL) were reacted for 24 h at 100°C. The crude
product was purified by flash chromatography on silica gel using
EtOAc:Pentane (1:1) as eluent. This afforded 62.5 mg of the title
compound (62% yield) as a colorless solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CD3CN) δ
(ppm) 7.04 (d, 1H, J = 16.0 Hz), 6.42 (bs, 1H, NH), 6.11 (d, 1H, J = 16.0
Hz), 5.53 (s, 1H), 5.27 (s, 1H), 4.30 (ddd, 1H, J = 8.8, 7.6, 5.6 Hz),
4.21 (dt, 1H, J = 8.8, 7.2 Hz), 5.21 (ddd, 1H, J = 13.2, 7.2, 5.6 Hz),
2.15 (ddd, 1H, J = 13.2, 7.6, 7.2 Hz), 1.41 (s, 3H), 1.33 (s, 9H). 13C
NMR (100 MHz, CD3CN) δ (ppm) 180.4, 165.2, 145.8, 137.9, 126.3, 118.6,
66.2, 51.7, 48.1, 35.9, 28.9, 22.8. HRMS C14H21O3N [M++Na]: calculate:
274.1419 found: 274.1409.
