$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Oxidative Heck Coupling of Enaminone 1: Enaminone 1a (37 mg, 0.20 mmol),
methylacrylate (34 mg, 0.40 mmol), Pd(OAc)2 (14 mg, 0.06 mmol), Cu(OAc)2
(110 mg, 0.60 mmol) and K2CO3 (55 mg, 0.40 mmol) combined in a 20:5:1
mixture of t-BuOH/AcOH/DMSO (2.0 mL) and stirred for 5 min. The reaction
mixture was heated to 80 °C and stirred until judged complete by TLC. The
reaction mixture was diluted with EtOAc (8 mL) and excess K2CO3 (~1 g)
was added to neutralize the AcOH. After stirring this mixture for 5 min
the precipitate was filtered over Celite using EtOAc as the eluent. The
filtrate was concentrated and purified by chromatography on silica gel
(65% EtOAc/ 35% hexanes). 5 was isolated as a waxy yellow solid. 5 1H NMR
(400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 2.53 (t, 2H, J = 7.8 Hz), 3.46 (t, 2H, J = 7.8 Hz),
3.71 (s, 3H), 4.51 (s, 2H), 6.66 (d, 1H, J = 15.6 Hz), 7.22 (d, 1H, J =
15.6 Hz), 7.26- 7.28 (m, 2H), 7.36-7.43 (m, 3H), 7.51 (s, 1H); 13C NMR
(100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 35.9, 46.2, 51.1, 60.7, 106.0, 110.9, 127.8 (2C),
128.9, 129.3 (2C), 134.4, 140.4, 156.9, 169.6, 188.7; IR (neat) 2948,
1696, 1653, 1596, 1436, 1224 cm-1; HRMS (ESI+) m/e calc'd for [M+H]+
C16H18NO3: 272.1287, found 272.1275.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective, stereoselective, Heck coupling, solvents used without
purification or degassing
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Palladium(II)-Catalyzed Direct Arylation of Enaminones Using
Organotrifluoroborates
